# Exception: `payments/` and `e2e/` are standalone npm packages — their package.json /
# package-lock.json must be tracked so deps resolve from a fresh clone (CI runs e2e).
!payments/package.json
!e2e/package.json
!e2e/package-lock.json

# e2e runtime artifacts (screenshots, on-chain fixture state)
